 "schema": 1,
 "name": "azure-deploy",
 "description": "Execute Azure deployments for ALREADY-PREPARED applications that have existing .azure/deployment-plan.md and infrastructure files. DO NOT use this skill when the user asks to CREATE a new application — use azure-prepare instead. This skill runs azd up, azd deploy, terraform apply, and az deployment commands with built-in error recovery. Requires .azure/deployment-plan.md from azure-prepare and validated status from azure-validate. WHEN: \\\"run azd up\\\", \\\"run azd deploy\\\", \\\"execute deployment\\\", \\\"push to production\\\", \\\"push to cloud\\\", \\\"go live\\\", \\\"ship it\\\", \\\"bicep deploy\\\",…",
